From: EmberBSD Ports contributors
Subject: [LOCAL] virtio-gpu: classic backing ownership ledger

Origin: EmberBSD, AI-assisted by Codex. Not submitted or accepted upstream.
Against pinned QEMU 6601422 after complete selected UTM overlay and C8b CREATE.
Original Red Hat authors and GPL-2.0-or-later notices remain in source.

